# wwwroot holds only the compiled Angular output (copied here by
# frontend/scripts/copy-to-wwwroot.mjs) - an artifact, not source, so ignore everything.
#
# Uploaded photos no longer live under wwwroot/uploads - they're written to persistent storage
# outside the app (see Storage:RootPath in appsettings / GhumoOdisha.Infrastructure.Storage) so a
# deploy can never overwrite them. Nothing under wwwroot is ever committed.
*
!.gitignore
